Package: tm.ttni
Title: Teal Module for Time-to-Next-Intervention and Time-to-Event Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "Yaoguang", "Ma",
    email = "ygma0929@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Provides an open-source 'teal' module and a reusable table
    builder for time to next intervention and related time-to-event
    endpoints. Kaplan-Meier summaries are produced with 'tern' and 'rtables'
    for both multi-arm (dose-level) and two-arm designs. Hazard ratio, Wald
    confidence interval, and log-rank p-value are calculated only when exactly
    two treatment arms are present. The builder can be called without
    launching 'shiny'.
